      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "40M x 2560 x 4 bytes             409.60 GB fp32\n40M x 1024 x 2 bytes              81.92 GB fp16 originals\n40M x 1024 x 1 byte               40.96 GB int8 copy\nRF 2: originals                 163.84 GB (disk)\nRF 2: quantized copy             81.92 GB (RAM target)\n\nADD: HNSW + sparse + payload indexes + page cache,\nshard/segment overhead, WAL, optimizer + recovery reserve.\nNo final node count follows from vector bytes alone.\n\n2560 -> 1024 = 2.5x at same datatype, not 4x.\nMeasure resident memory + disk IOPS on a real sample.",
      "originalText": "40M x 2560 x 4 bytes             409.60 GB fp32\n40M x 1024 x 2 bytes              81.92 GB fp16 originals\n40M x 1024 x 1 byte               40.96 GB int8 copy\nRF 2: originals                 163.84 GB (disk)\nRF 2: quantized copy             81.92 GB (RAM target)\n\nADD: HNSW + sparse + payload indexes + page cache,\nshard/segment overhead, WAL, optimizer + recovery reserve.\nNo final node count follows from vector bytes alone.\n\n2560 -> 1024 = 2.5x at same datatype, not 4x.\nMeasure resident memory + disk IOPS on a real sample.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
