      "text": "VALUE                  KEY COMPONENTS                                   VALIDITY\nSEC evidence           CIK + accession + parser + content hash            immutable\nNews / market evidence source + query identity + fetched payload hash     source TTL\nChunk embedding        content hash + model revision + dims + preprocess immutable\nQuery embedding        exact text hash + embedding fingerprint           bounded TTL\nRetrieval packets      query + filters + index_release + retrieval_config release\nMemo                   exact snapshot + request + prompt + model/settings snapshot\nVerification decision  memo hash + verifier version + output policy       policy version\n\nQuote used in memo is immutable. A refreshed live quote is a separate display.\nCoalesce identical misses; log hit/miss and cold/warm tests, not promised hit bands.\nCustomer-scoped private data; issuer CIK filtering is not customer authorization.",
      "originalText": "VALUE                  KEY COMPONENTS                                   VALIDITY\nSEC evidence           CIK + accession + parser + content hash            immutable\nNews / market evidence source + query identity + fetched payload hash     source TTL\nChunk embedding        content hash + model revision + dims + preprocess immutable\nQuery embedding        exact text hash + embedding fingerprint           bounded TTL\nRetrieval packets      query + filters + index_release + retrieval_config release\nMemo                   exact snapshot + request + prompt + model/settings snapshot\nVerification decision  memo hash + verifier version + output policy       policy version\n\nQuote used in memo is immutable. A refreshed live quote is a separate display.\nCoalesce identical misses; log hit/miss and cold/warm tests, not promised hit bands.\nCustomer-scoped private data; issuer CIK filtering is not customer authorization.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
