      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "POST /analyze -> 202 {job_id, events_url}\n  UNIQUE(customer_id, idempotency_key); compare request_hash\nGET /jobs/{id}/events  (authorize customer, Last-Event-ID)\n  persisted seq + job_id + attempt + memo_version\nclaim job: short SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED txn\n  increment attempt, set lease_until; release row lock\ncommit result: WHERE attempt = lease_attempt AND running\n  final memo + terminal event in one transaction\noptional Streams: job + outbox txn; ACK after durable commit",
      "originalText": "POST /analyze -> 202 {job_id, events_url}\n  UNIQUE(customer_id, idempotency_key); compare request_hash\nGET /jobs/{id}/events  (authorize customer, Last-Event-ID)\n  persisted seq + job_id + attempt + memo_version\nclaim job: short SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED txn\n  increment attempt, set lease_until; release row lock\ncommit result: WHERE attempt = lease_attempt AND running\n  final memo + terminal event in one transaction\noptional Streams: job + outbox txn; ACK after durable commit",
      "textAlign": "left",
